        "category": "description",
        "text": "\nThe SUSE Linux Enterprise Micro 6.0 and Micro 6.1 RT kernel was updated to fix the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-43284: xfrm: esp: avoid in-place decrypt on shared skb frags (bsc#1264449).\n- CVE-2026-43500: rxrpc: unshare DATA/RESPONSE packets when paged frags are present (bsc#1264450).\n",
